+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BhK4wGbPscHsYvaEotSx9H","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 4: Delayed and Scheduled Tasks\n2\t\n3\tAdd the ability to defer tasks so they only become available for processing after a specified time.\n4\t\n5\t## Requirements\n6\t\n7\t- A task can be given a delay (in milliseconds) or a specific future time at which it becomes available.\n8\t- Delayed tasks are added to the queue immediately but are not returned when retrieving until their availability time has passed.\n9\t- Non-delayed tasks are always preferred over delayed tasks that are not yet available.\n10\t- When multiple delayed tasks become available simultaneously, they should be ordered by availability time, then priority, then FIFO.\n11\t- The task object should indicate when it becomes available.\n12\t- Delays work correctly with named queues.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20aeb57a-18a3-4f7d-96c4-d858fa822389","uuid":"0b81ef10-4497-4509-8ead-1c7f5969128d","timestamp":"2026-05-31T00:39:36.275Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/phases/phase-04.md","content":"# Phase 4: Delayed and Scheduled Tasks\n\nAdd the ability to defer tasks so they only become available for processing after a specified time.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- A task can be given a delay (in milliseconds) or a specific future time at which it becomes available.\n- Delayed tasks are added to the queue immediately but are not returned when retrieving until their availability time has passed.\n- Non-delayed tasks are always preferred over delayed tasks that are not yet available.\n- When multiple delayed tasks become available simultaneously, they should be ordered by availability time, then priority, then FIFO.\n- The task object should indicate when it becomes available.\n- Delays work correctly with named queues.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}}}
