+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TeuGKmPkovbm8ev9hYDQm6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 9: Progress Tracking and Cancellation\n2\t\n3\tAdd the ability to report progress on running tasks and to cancel tasks.\n4\t\n5\t## Requirements\n6\t\n7\t- A processing task can report its progress as a percentage (0-100) with an optional message.\n8\t- There should be a way to query a task's current progress.\n9\t- Listeners can subscribe to progress updates for a task and receive notifications when progress changes.\n10\t- Subscriptions should be cancellable (unsubscribe).\n11\t- Tasks in pending or processing state can be cancelled.\n12\t- Cancelled pending tasks are removed from the queue and will not be returned.\n13\t- Cancelled processing tasks have their status updated accordingly.\n14\t- Cancelled tasks are never retried, even if they had retries remaining.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20aeb57a-18a3-4f7d-96c4-d858fa822389","uuid":"7d10f7f4-056b-4ea0-b61d-bf725cd5840c","timestamp":"2026-05-31T00:39:42.223Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/phases/phase-09.md","content":"# Phase 9: Progress Tracking and Cancellation\n\nAdd the ability to report progress on running tasks and to cancel tasks.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- A processing task can report its progress as a percentage (0-100) with an optional message.\n- There should be a way to query a task's current progress.\n- Listeners can subscribe to progress updates for a task and receive notifications when progress changes.\n- Subscriptions should be cancellable (unsubscribe).\n- Tasks in pending or processing state can be cancelled.\n- Cancelled pending tasks are removed from the queue and will not be returned.\n- Cancelled processing tasks have their status updated accordingly.\n- Cancelled tasks are never retried, even if they had retries remaining.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
